name: ['Argivian Welcome', 'Argothian Uprooting', 'Assemble the Team', "By Elspeth's Command", 'Crucias, Titan of the Waves', 'Fallaji Antiquarian', 'Forgefire Automaton', 'Foundry Groundbreaker', 'Gixian Recycler', 'Great Desert Hellion', 'History of Benalia', "Hurkyl's Prodigy", 'Jarsyl, Dark Age Scion', "Kayla's Kindling", 'Legion of Clay', 'Lonely End', 'Melt Through', "Norn's Disassembly", 'Patchplate Resolute', 'Penregon Besieged', 'Perilous Iteration', 'Piece It Together', 'Raddic, Tal Zealot', 'Richlau, Headmaster', 'Rusko, Clockmaker', 'Sylvan Smite', 'Tawnos Endures', 'Tomakul Phoenix', "Urza's Construction Drone", 'Warzone Duplicator', 'Yotian Courier']
